From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:54:21 +0000
Subject: fix(ohos): keep inline-box chrome with its text when wrapping

OH_Drawing placeholders are standalone SkParagraph words, so a text-only
inline-box group could leave its leading edge chrome at a line end while
the token wrapped. Such groups now reserve each edge with a zero-font
U+2011 carrying the edge width as letter spacing, bounded by U+200B;
groups with placeholder-backed children keep the placeholder lowering.

Fork-Patch: ohos-inline-box-atomic-text-edges
Origin: botiverse/KuiklyUI#105 764fb15e56961d55812ffc0205a4103633fd1b30
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

